      "description": "Rigorous physical organic and mechanistic exploration of carbonyl chemistry: electronic polarization and B\u00fcrgi-Dunitz 107\u00b0 nucleophilic trajectory, reversible hydration and acetal thermodynamics, irreversible organometallic additions, imine/enamine equilibria, deoxygenation protocols (Wolff-Kishner, Clemmensen, Mozingo), Baeyer-Villiger migratory aptitudes, enol-enolate equilibria, and aldol, Claisen-Schmidt, Cannizzaro, Benzoin, Perkin, and Knoevenagel condensation cascades.",
