      "description": "Exhaustive treatment of multi-heteroatom and condensed heterocyclic systems: electronic structure and amphoteric equilibria of 1,3-azoles (imidazole, pyrazole, oxazole, thiazole) and Breslow carbene intermediates; pyrimidine and purine nucleic acid bases (uracil, thymine, cytosine, adenine, guanine), lactam-lactim tautomerism, and hydrogen-bonding networks; indole syntheses (Fischer indole, Madelung) and C3 electrophilic substitution regiocontrol; quinoline syntheses (Skraup, Doebner-Miller, Friedl\u00e4nder) and C5/C8 vs C2/C4 reactivity; and isoquinoline syntheses (Bischler-Napieralski, Pictet-Spengler).",
